## Project-specific notes

Rules that apply only to this project. The template never overwrites this file.

Edited by the engineer, in a pull request. The agent does not write here: this is a protected path, and a rule that arrives without review is a rule nobody agreed to. To propose one, `make start` and choose process-change.

Bug notes do not go here. They go to the issue log (`make log`), which the weekly audit reads.
